# 0004. Powerlevel10k prompt with instant prompt, `p10k.zsh` edited by hand

- Status: Accepted
- Date: 2026-11-11

## Context
The prompt must draw instantly and show an OS logo and colours matching the archminimal theme.

## Decision
Powerlevel10k, loaded by zinit, with instant prompt sourced at the top of `zshrc`. `p10k.zsh` is
kept in the repo and edited by hand; `p10k configure` is never run.

## Alternatives
- starship: one more binary, a process per prompt, no instant prompt.
- pure / a hand-written prompt: less information, slower git status.

## Consequences
- Perceived startup near zero.
- Nothing may print or prompt for input during startup (see [0003](0003-startup-budget-cached-inits.adr)).
- `p10k configure` would overwrite the custom logo and colours.

## References
`zshrc`, `p10k.zsh`, `conf.d/20-plugins.zsh`.
